	(text "BoardCom - the only electrical link between the two MCUs"
		(at 145.7 96.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3364b1f7-b24a-47f5-a5e7-f346f844e0de")
	)
	(text "BOARDCOM_A:  motor IO16  <->  driver IO38"
		(at 145.7 122.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4f4ef5cc-2698-4b0d-a603-bf658e9dc04c")
	)
	(text "BOARDCOM_B:  motor IO15  <->  driver IO39"
		(at 145.7 127.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c8d7a2ce-af31-49d3-ae77-f6e776e84252")
	)
	(text "(the crossover is the one the mated H1 headers used to make:"
		(at 145.7 133.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "acd7dfc9-8568-4500-ab7a-b5e6639b63cf")
	)
	(text " motor H1.1/1.3 -> driver H1.1/1.3 with BOARDCOM1/2 swapped between the boards)"
		(at 145.7 138.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e9a7ae66-0604-49d0-a959-01ac03b9a35c")
	)
	(text "SHARED ACROSS BOTH SECTIONS"
		(at 25 165 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.4 2.4)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e6b5c360-9180-4699-ad66-02fd1d337ac5")
	)
	(text "VIN (XT60 input, was H1 pins 6/8/10)   -   GND (was H1 pins 5/7/9)"
		(at 25 172 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1bc3f254-1294-4e95-ad3d-1f9cbc1bea5d")
	)
	(text "+3V3   -   one LM2596 (U116, 3 A) now feeds both sections.  The driver board's 0.5 A MP2459 and its chain (U2, L3, D2, D6, C80, C81, R61-R63) are deleted;"
		(at 25 178 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a3a32daa-1ff0-4e98-a899-004437801c7a")
	)
	(text "            D7 is kept and ORs the driver USB port's VBUS into the shared buck input, so either USB port can still power the board."
		(at 25 184 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "827fc64e-e3bb-4079-a1bf-e76ee78dafb5")
	)
	(text "RST   -   one EN net.  SW2 resets both MCUs; R28 (10k) + C134 (1 uF) are the single RC.  R128 and C30 deleted."
		(at 25 190 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ba471cd6-c9a3-4762-a4d1-5330c4653169")
	)
	(text "Also removed as redundant:  D101 + R115 (second power-on LED; LED2 + R17 kept), and D102/D103 changed SS14 -> SS36 to match D7."
		(at 25 196 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9a8b1fe7-54ea-402d-a73a-07e31f8206ae")
	)
	(text "Kept separate on purpose:  BOOT_MC / BOOT_DRV, the two USB-C ports, and the two MCUs themselves."
		(at 25 205 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a7ab3749-c2b2-410b-a875-9eb588d68126")
	)
	(text "Motor-section reference designators are the originals + 100 (U2 -> U102, ...) so they do not collide with the driver section."
		(at 25 211 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c351dbe1-a5df-42d6-a21b-409528d636d6")
	)
